@HostAddress = http://localhost:5090

### Get all applications
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/applications
Accept: application/json

### Get one application
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/applications/1
Accept: application/json

### Search
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/applications/search?companyName=Tech&status=Applied
Accept: application/json

### Create
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobSource": "LinkedIn",
  "applyDate": "2026-11-05T00:00:00",
  "companyName": "Example Co",
  "jobTitle": "Junior .NET Developer",
  "jobLink": "https://example.com/jobs/1",
  "country": "Italy",
  "city": "Turin",
  "workMode": "hybrid",
  "employmentType": "full-time",
  "jobStatus": "Applied"
}

### Update
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/applications/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobSource": "LinkedIn",
  "applyDate": "2026-11-05T00:00:00",
  "companyName": "Example Co",
  "jobTitle": "Junior .NET Developer",
  "jobStatus": "Interview"
}

### Delete
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/applications/1